OL,3,GNEWSAProtest as rail freight scheme
OL,4,Aplanning process starts
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have protested against
OL,7,Fplans for a new rail freight
OL,8,Finterchange as a planning inspectorate
OL,9,Fprocess got under way.
OL,11,FThe application for the facility near
OL,12,FArdley, Oxfordshire, includes 6.5
OL,13,Fmillion sq ft of warehouses and a hub
OL,14,Fto transfer goods from roads to the
OL,15,Frailway line.
OL,17,FProtestor Philip Norstrand said there
OL,18,Fwere fears the project "has very little
OL,19,Fto do with rail freight".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
