OL,3,GNEWSAProtest as rail freight scheme
OL,4,Aplanning process starts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Oxfordshire Strategic Rail Freight
OL,7,FInterchange (OxSRFI) said the proposal
OL,8,Fwas "a response to the government's
OL,9,Fambitions to maximise the use of rail
OL,10,Ffreight in the supply chain".
